      ],
      "image": "assets/images/45782/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly oil grill grate. Grill fish for 7 minutes, then turn and drizzle with butter. Continue cooking for 7 minutes, or until easily flaked with a fork. Drizzle with olive oil before serving.",
